Package: FishHist
Type: Package
Title: Southeast Fisheries Management History Data
Version: 1.0
Authors@R: c(person("Sarina", "Atkinson", , "sarina.atkinson@noaa.gov", role = c("aut", "cre")), person("Gaitlyn", "Malone", role="aut"))
BugReports: https://github.com/SEFSC/FishHist/issues
Description: Houses code to process fisheries management 
    data into an analysis-friendly format where all indivudal regualtions 
    published from Federal Registrar (FR) notices are connected. 
    Functions to analyze and visualize the analysis-friendly 
    management history data.
